# Clock discipline at the edge of the crystal spec, over CAN and over WiFi,
# and a Central reboot starting a new timeline (epoch).
at 0.0  drift imu 400
at 0.0  drift stress 250
at 0.0  drift corner_fr -400
at 0.0  drift dashboard 300
at 10.0 expect can sync_err_us < 50
at 10.0 expect can synced == 1
at 10.0 expect corners sync_err_us < 1000
at 10.0 expect corners synced == 1

at 12.0 reboot central
at 16.0 expect can event:TIME_SYNCED >= 2
at 20.0 expect can sync_err_us < 50
at 20.0 expect corners sync_err_us < 1000
at 20.0 expect central boot_count == 2
at 20.0 expect all state == RUN
# Corner samples keep flowing on the new timeline (no stale grid indices).
at 20.0 expect IMU_FL_ACCEL_X age_ms < 100
at 20.0 expect IMU_FR_ACCEL_X age_ms < 100
at 20.0 expect corners lost == 0
end 20.0
